41
00:02:31,166 --> 00:02:31,500
Open it.

42
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:32,700
Open it.

43
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,533
If there are any consequences,

44
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:35,966
I Miao family will bear it.

45
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,000
break

46
00:03:03,566 --> 00:03:04,466
It's the Soul Suppressing Nail,

47
