52
00:03:52,366 --> 00:03:53,100
Evil spirit.

53
00:03:55,366 --> 00:04:00,266
I've been waiting for you in this coffin for ten years.

54
00:04:00,566 --> 00:04:02,900
The place chosen by Elder Lei ten years ago

55
00:04:02,900 --> 00:04:04,166
right in the center of the Ghost Division.

56
00:04:04,166 --> 00:04:06,566
You've been in this coffin for ten years.

57
00:04:09,333 --> 00:04:11,066
Thank you for untying the Soul Binding Nail.

58
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:13,566
When I go to the Tian Gong Building to find my mother,

59
00:04:14,166 --> 00:04:16,200
